{
 "netpack": 1,
 "name": "boulevard_junctions",
 "version": "0.2.0",
 "author": "netmod (task bvx)",
 "description": "Boulevard junctions with avenues and with other boulevards: where an avenue (two parallel roads) or another boulevard (three) crosses a boulevard, ends on it, or the boulevard ends on it, sc3netmod's BV block makes the crossing one paved box: crosswalks across every arm at the box edge, curbs round the outer corners and along the far side of a T, every median ending in a concrete nose with its trees. Needs the boulevard package (its pieces next to the box). Box cells 20900..20905 (one per edge pattern, base 43), avenue nose cells 20910 / 20911 (base 11204). Built by `bvx.py build .` in this folder before install (art/ is made from the game's frames and is not shipped).",
